{"title": "Profit and Loss: Dishonest seller (Level 2)", "duration_min": 20.0, "questions": [{"q_en": "<p>A dishonest dealer sells his goods at a 30% loss on the cost price but uses a faulty weight that weighs 18% less. His profit or loss percentage (rounded off to 2 decimal places) is:</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2348;&#2375;&#2312;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2346;&#2366;&#2352;&#2368; &#2309;&#2346;&#2344;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2354; &#2354;&#2366;&#2327;&#2340; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351; &#2346;&#2352; 30% &#2325;&#2368; &#2361;&#2366;&#2344;&#2367; &#2346;&#2352; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2354;&#2375;&#2325;&#2367;&#2344; &#2319;&#2325; &#2342;&#2379;&#2359;&#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339; &#2348;&#2366;&#2335; &#2325;&#2366; &#2313;&#2346;&#2351;&#2379;&#2327; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; &#2357;&#2332;&#2344; 18% &#2325;&#2350; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2366;&#2344;&#2367; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2358;&#2340; (2 &#2342;&#2358;&#2350;&#2354;&#2357; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2340;&#2325; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339;&#2366;&#2306;&#2325;&#2367;&#2340;) &#2361;&#2376;:</p>", "options_en": ["14.63% loss", "16.67% loss", "16.67% profit", "14.63% profit"], "options_hi": ["14.63% &#2361;&#2366;&#2344;&#2367;", "16.67% &#2361;&#2366;&#2344;&#2367;", "16.67% &#2354;&#2366;&#2349;", "14.63% &#2354;&#2366;&#2349;"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>30% = 3/10</p><p>C.P = 10, S.P = 7</p><p>Actual C.P = 10 * 82/100 = 8.2</p><p>Loss % = (C.P  -  S.P) * 1100/C.P</p><p>= (8.2  -  7) * 100/8.2</p><p>= 14.63%</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>30% = 3/10</p><p>C.P = 10, S.P = 7</p><p>Actual C.P = 10 * 82/100 = 8.2</p><p>Loss % = (C.P  -  S.P) * 1100/C.P</p><p>= (8.2  -  7) * 100/8.2</p><p>= 14.63%</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>A street vendor claims to sell organic apples at a 10% discount on the actual cost price. However, his weighing scale gives X% less weight. If his overall profit% is (100/17)%, then find the value of X?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2360;&#2381;&#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2368;&#2335; &#2357;&#2375;&#2306;&#2337;&#2352; &#2357;&#2366;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2357;&#2367;&#2325; &#2354;&#2366;&#2327;&#2340; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351; &#2346;&#2352; 10% &#2331;&#2370;&#2335; &#2346;&#2352; &#2332;&#2376;&#2357;&#2367;&#2325; &#2360;&#2375;&#2348; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366; &#2342;&#2366;&#2357;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2361;&#2366;&#2354;&#2366;&#2305;&#2325;&#2367;, &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; &#2340;&#2380;&#2354; &#2346;&#2376;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366; X% &#2325;&#2350; &#2357;&#2332;&#2344; &#2342;&#2375;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2369;&#2354; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349;% (100/17)% &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; X &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;?</p>", "options_en": ["12", "15", "10", "20"], "options_hi": ["12", "15", "10", "20"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>10% discount = 1/10 or SP/CP = 9/10</p><p>Actual weight = (100 - X) gm, value charge for 100 gm.</p><p>Profit% = (100/17)% = 1/17 or SP/CP = 18/17</p><p>By Ratio method,</p><p>(9/10) x (100/100- x) = 18/17</p><p>85 = 100 - x</p><p>x = 15</p><p></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>10% discount = 1/10 or SP/CP = 9/10</p><p>Actual weight = (100 - X) gm, value charge for 100 gm.</p><p>Profit% = (100/17)% = 1/17 or SP/CP = 18/17</p><p>By Ratio method,</p><p>(9/10) x (100/100- x) = 18/17</p><p>85 = 100 - x</p><p>x = 15</p><p></p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>A dishonest dealer professes to sell his goods at cost price but uses a false weight of 860 grams instead of 1 kg. His gain percentage is:</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2348;&#2375;&#2312;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2346;&#2366;&#2352;&#2368; &#2309;&#2346;&#2344;&#2375; &#2350;&#2366;&#2354; &#2325;&#2379; &#2354;&#2366;&#2327;&#2340; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351; &#2346;&#2352; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366; &#2342;&#2366;&#2357;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2354;&#2375;&#2325;&#2367;&#2344; 1 &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2332;&#2366;&#2351; 860 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2325;&#2366; &#2327;&#2354;&#2340; &#2357;&#2332;&#2344; &#2311;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2375;&#2350;&#2366;&#2354; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2358;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;:</p>", "options_en": ["900/43%", "625/43%", "700/43%", "680/43%"], "options_hi": ["900/43%", "625/43%", "700/43%", "680/43%"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>Gain = (Faulty weight  -  actual weight) * 100/actual weight</p><p>= (1000  -  860) * 100/860</p><p>= 700/43%</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Gain = (Faulty weight  -  actual weight) * 100/actual weight</p><p>= (1000  -  860) * 100/860</p><p>= 700/43%</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>A coffee shop owner claims to sell premium coffee beans at the actual cost price. However, instead of giving 1 kilogram as advertised, he only provides 760 grams. What is his overall profit percentage?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2325;&#2377;&#2347;&#2368; &#2358;&#2377;&#2346; &#2350;&#2366;&#2354;&#2367;&#2325; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2368;&#2350;&#2367;&#2351;&#2350; &#2325;&#2377;&#2347;&#2368; &#2348;&#2368;&#2344;&#2381;&#2360; &#2325;&#2379; &#2357;&#2366;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2357;&#2367;&#2325; &#2354;&#2366;&#2327;&#2340; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351; &#2346;&#2352; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366; &#2342;&#2366;&#2357;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2361;&#2366;&#2354;&#2366;&#2305;&#2325;&#2367;, &#2357;&#2367;&#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2346;&#2367;&#2340; 1 &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2342;&#2375;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2332;&#2366;&#2351;, &#2357;&#2361; &#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; 760 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2342;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2369;&#2354; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2358;&#2340; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["500/19%", "400/19%", "700/19%", "600/19%"], "options_hi": ["500/19%", "400/19%", "700/19%", "600/19%"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>Gain = (Faulty weight  -  actual weight) * 100/actual weight</p><p>= (1000  -  760) * 100/760</p><p>= 600/19%</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Gain = (Faulty weight  -  actual weight) * 100/actual weight</p><p>= (1000  -  760) * 100/760</p><p>= 600/19%</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>A trader sells sugar at a X% profit and uses weights 10% less than the actual measure. If his gain percentage is 28(8/9)%, then find the value of X..</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2346;&#2366;&#2352;&#2368; X% &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2346;&#2352; &#2330;&#2368;&#2344;&#2368; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; &#2357;&#2366;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2357;&#2367;&#2325; &#2350;&#2366;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; 10% &#2325;&#2350; &#2357;&#2332;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; &#2313;&#2346;&#2351;&#2379;&#2327; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2358;&#2340; 28(8/9)% &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; X &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["16", "12", "14", "20"], "options_hi": ["16", "12", "14", "20"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>By the Ratio method,</p><p>Profit% = 28(8/9)% = 260/9% = 13/45 or SP/CP = 58/45</p><p>SP/CP = (100 + X)/100 * (100/90) = 58/45</p><p>(100 + X)/90 = 58/45</p><p>100 + X = 116</p><p>X = 16</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>By the Ratio method,</p><p>Profit% = 28(8/9)% = 260/9% = 13/45 or SP/CP = 58/45</p><p>SP/CP = (100 + X)/100 * (100/90) = 58/45</p><p>(100 + X)/90 = 58/45</p><p>100 + X = 116</p><p>X = 16</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>A grocery store owner sells rice at a marked profit of 24%. However, he uses a weighing scale that delivers only 850 grams instead of the full 1 kilogram. What is his actual overall profit percentage? (Round your answer to two decimal places.)</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2325;&#2367;&#2352;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366; &#2360;&#2381;&#2335;&#2379;&#2352; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2354;&#2367;&#2325; 24% &#2325;&#2375; &#2309;&#2306;&#2325;&#2367;&#2340; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2346;&#2352; &#2330;&#2366;&#2357;&#2354; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2361;&#2366;&#2354;&#2366;&#2305;&#2325;&#2367;, &#2357;&#2361; &#2319;&#2325; &#2340;&#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2370; &#2325;&#2366; &#2313;&#2346;&#2351;&#2379;&#2327; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2332;&#2379; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2375; 1 &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2332;&#2366;&#2351; &#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; 850 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2342;&#2375;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; &#2357;&#2366;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2357;&#2367;&#2325; &#2360;&#2350;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2358;&#2340; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;? (&#2309;&#2346;&#2344;&#2375; &#2313;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340;&#2352; &#2325;&#2379; &#2342;&#2379; &#2342;&#2358;&#2350;&#2354;&#2357; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2340;&#2325; &#2327;&#2379;&#2354; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404;)</p>", "options_en": ["49.67%", "45.88%", "47.11%", "42.33%"], "options_hi": ["49.67%", "45.88%", "47.11%", "42.33%"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>By Ratio method,</p><p>SP/CP = (124/100) x (1000/850) = 124/85</p><p>Profit% = 39 x 100/85 = 45.88%</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>By Ratio method,</p><p>SP/CP = (124/100) x (1000/850) = 124/85</p><p>Profit% = 39 x 100/85 = 45.88%</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>At a countryside food fair, a merchant sells 12 kg of rice with a 15% festival discount. The marked price is &#8377;52 per kg, while the actual cost price is &#8377;45 per kg. Unknown to buyers, the merchant's weighing scale gives only 800 grams when it shows 1 kg. What is his actual profit percentage? (Round your answer to two decimal places.)</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350;&#2368;&#2339; &#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2375;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352; &#2325;&#2375; &#2326;&#2366;&#2342;&#2381;&#2351; &#2350;&#2375;&#2354;&#2375; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;, &#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2346;&#2366;&#2352;&#2368; 15% &#2340;&#2381;&#2351;&#2380;&#2361;&#2366;&#2352;&#2368; &#2331;&#2370;&#2335; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2366;&#2341; 12 &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379; &#2330;&#2366;&#2357;&#2354; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2309;&#2306;&#2325;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351; 52 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2332;&#2348;&#2325;&#2367; &#2357;&#2366;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2357;&#2367;&#2325; &#2354;&#2366;&#2327;&#2340; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351; 45 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2326;&#2352;&#2368;&#2342;&#2366;&#2352;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2346;&#2340;&#2366; &#2344;&#2361;&#2368;&#2306; &#2361;&#2376; &#2325;&#2367; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2346;&#2366;&#2352;&#2368; &#2325;&#2366; &#2340;&#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2370; 1 &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379; &#2342;&#2367;&#2326;&#2366;&#2340;&#2375; &#2361;&#2369;&#2319; &#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; 800 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2342;&#2375;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; &#2357;&#2366;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2357;&#2367;&#2325; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2358;&#2340; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;? (&#2309;&#2346;&#2344;&#2375; &#2313;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340;&#2352; &#2325;&#2379; &#2342;&#2379; &#2342;&#2358;&#2350;&#2354;&#2357; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2340;&#2325; &#2327;&#2379;&#2354; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404;)</p>", "options_en": ["24.45%", "28.88%", "22.77%", "26.67%"], "options_hi": ["24.45%", "28.88%", "22.77%", "26.67%"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>C.P = Rs. 45, M.P = Rs. 52</p><p>Actual C.P = 45 * 800/1000 = Rs. 36</p><p>S.P = M.P * (100  -  Discount)/100 = 52 * 85/100 = Rs. 44.2</p><p>Profit = (S.P  -  C.P) * 100/C.P</p><p>= (44.2  -  36) * 100/36</p><p>= 22.77%</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>C.P = Rs. 45, M.P = Rs. 52</p><p>Actual C.P = 45 * 800/1000 = Rs. 36</p><p>S.P = M.P * (100  -  Discount)/100 = 52 * 85/100 = Rs. 44.2</p><p>Profit = (S.P  -  C.P) * 100/C.P</p><p>= (44.2  -  36) * 100/36</p><p>= 22.77%</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>A vendor at a farmers' market offers a 10% discount on a 10 kg pack of lentils. The cost price for him is &#8377;40 per kg, and the pack is marked at &#8377;50 per kg. However, his weighing scale is rigged- it shows 1 kg when it weighs only 850 grams. What is the vendor's actual profit percentage? (Round off to two decimal places.)</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2366;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2332;&#2364;&#2366;&#2352; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2340;&#2366; &#2342;&#2366;&#2354; &#2325;&#2375; 10 &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379; &#2325;&#2375; &#2346;&#2376;&#2325;&#2375;&#2335; &#2346;&#2352; 10% &#2325;&#2368; &#2331;&#2370;&#2335; &#2342;&#2375; &#2352;&#2361;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2354;&#2366;&#2327;&#2340; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351; 40 &#2337;&#2377;&#2354;&#2352; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2324;&#2352; &#2346;&#2376;&#2325;&#2375;&#2335; &#2346;&#2352; 50 &#2337;&#2377;&#2354;&#2352; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379; &#2309;&#2306;&#2325;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2361;&#2366;&#2354;&#2366;&#2305;&#2325;&#2367;, &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; &#2340;&#2380;&#2354;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366; &#2346;&#2376;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366; &#2327;&#2337;&#2364;&#2348;&#2337;&#2364; &#2361;&#2376; - &#2351;&#2361; 1 &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379; &#2342;&#2367;&#2326;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2332;&#2348;&#2325;&#2367; &#2311;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; &#2357;&#2332;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; 850 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2340;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2357;&#2366;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2357;&#2367;&#2325; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2358;&#2340; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;? (&#2342;&#2379; &#2342;&#2358;&#2350;&#2354;&#2357; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2340;&#2325; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339;&#2366;&#2306;&#2325;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404;)</p>", "options_en": ["29.11%", "37.85%", "27.88%", "32.35%"], "options_hi": ["29.11%", "37.85%", "27.88%", "32.35%"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>C.P = Rs. 40, M.P = Rs. 50</p><p>Actual C.P = 40 * 850/1000</p><p>= Rs. 34</p><p>S.P = M.P * (100  -  Discount)/100 = 50 * 90/100 = Rs. 45</p><p>Profit = (S.P  -  C.P) * 100/C.P</p><p>= (45  -  34) * 100/34</p><p>= 32.35%</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>C.P = Rs. 40, M.P = Rs. 50</p><p>Actual C.P = 40 * 850/1000</p><p>= Rs. 34</p><p>S.P = M.P * (100  -  Discount)/100 = 50 * 90/100 = Rs. 45</p><p>Profit = (S.P  -  C.P) * 100/C.P</p><p>= (45  -  34) * 100/34</p><p>= 32.35%</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>A dishonest shopkeeper sells wheat at Rs. 102 per kg which he has bought at Rs. 80 per kg and he is giving 850 gm instead of 1000 gm. Find his actual profit percentage.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2348;&#2375;&#2312;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2342;&#2369;&#2325;&#2366;&#2344;&#2342;&#2366;&#2352; 102 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379; &#2327;&#2375;&#2361;&#2370;&#2306; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2375; &#2313;&#2360;&#2344;&#2375; 80 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379; &#2326;&#2352;&#2368;&#2342;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; &#2357;&#2361; 1000 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2332;&#2366;&#2351; 850 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2342;&#2375; &#2352;&#2361;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; &#2357;&#2366;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2357;&#2367;&#2325; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2358;&#2340; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["50%", "45%", "60%", "65%"], "options_hi": ["50%", "45%", "60%", "65%"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>C.P = Rs. 80, S.P = 102</p><p>Actual C.P = 80 * 850/1000 = Rs. 68</p><p>Profit = (S.P  -  C.P) * 100/C.P</p><p>= (102  -  68) * 100/68</p><p>= 50%</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>C.P = Rs. 80, S.P = 102</p><p>Actual C.P = 80 * 850/1000 = Rs. 68</p><p>Profit = (S.P  -  C.P) * 100/C.P</p><p>= (102  -  68) * 100/68</p><p>= 50%</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>A shopkeeper sells rice at &#8377;134.40 per kg, which he originally purchased at &#8377;120 per kg. However, instead of giving a full 1 kg (1000 grams), he secretly gives only X grams. If his actual profit percentage turns out to be 40%, how many grams of rice (X) is he giving to the customer?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2342;&#2369;&#2325;&#2366;&#2344;&#2342;&#2366;&#2352; &#2330;&#2366;&#2357;&#2354; &#2325;&#2379; 134.40 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2346;&#2352; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2375; &#2313;&#2360;&#2344;&#2375; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; 120 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2346;&#2352; &#2326;&#2352;&#2368;&#2342;&#2366; &#2341;&#2366;&#2404; &#2361;&#2366;&#2354;&#2366;&#2305;&#2325;&#2367;, &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2366; 1 &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; (1000 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350;) &#2342;&#2375;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2332;&#2366;&#2351;, &#2357;&#2361; &#2327;&#2369;&#2346;&#2381;&#2340; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; X &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2342;&#2375;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; &#2357;&#2366;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2357;&#2367;&#2325; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2358;&#2340; 40% &#2344;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2357;&#2361; &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2361;&#2325; &#2325;&#2379; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2375; &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2330;&#2366;&#2357;&#2354; (X) &#2342;&#2375; &#2352;&#2361;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["820", "800", "850", "870"], "options_hi": ["820", "800", "850", "870"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>By the ratio method,</p><p>Profit% = 40% or SP/CP = 7/5</p><p>Now,</p><p>(134.4/120) x (1000/X) = 7/5</p><p>X = 800</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>By the ratio method,</p><p>Profit% = 40% or SP/CP = 7/5</p><p>Now,</p><p>(134.4/120) x (1000/X) = 7/5</p><p>X = 800</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>At a medieval village market, a merchant prices his spices with a 25% markup but offers a 10% \"generosity discount\" to attract more travelers. However, his weighing stones are deceptive- they show 1 kilogram when he actually gives only 900 grams. What is the merchant's true profit percentage?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2350;&#2343;&#2381;&#2351;&#2351;&#2369;&#2327;&#2368;&#2344; &#2327;&#2366;&#2306;&#2357; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2332;&#2366;&#2352; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;, &#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2346;&#2366;&#2352;&#2368; &#2309;&#2346;&#2344;&#2375; &#2350;&#2360;&#2366;&#2354;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2368; &#2325;&#2368;&#2350;&#2340; 25% &#2350;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2325;&#2309;&#2346; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2366;&#2341; &#2352;&#2326;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2354;&#2375;&#2325;&#2367;&#2344; &#2309;&#2343;&#2367;&#2325; &#2351;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2351;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2310;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; 10% \"&#2313;&#2342;&#2366;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2331;&#2370;&#2335;\" &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2342;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2361;&#2366;&#2354;&#2366;&#2305;&#2325;&#2367;, &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2375; &#2340;&#2380;&#2354;&#2344;&#2375; &#2357;&#2366;&#2354;&#2375; &#2346;&#2340;&#2381;&#2341;&#2352; &#2349;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350;&#2325; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306; - &#2357;&#2375; 1 &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2342;&#2367;&#2326;&#2366;&#2340;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306; &#2332;&#2348;&#2325;&#2367; &#2357;&#2361; &#2357;&#2366;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2357; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; 900 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2342;&#2375;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2346;&#2366;&#2352;&#2368; &#2325;&#2366; &#2357;&#2366;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2357;&#2367;&#2325; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2358;&#2340; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["20%", "35%", "25%", "15%"], "options_hi": ["20%", "35%", "25%", "15%"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>Let the C.P be Rs. '100'</p><p>The ratio of S.P to C.P = (100 * 125/100 * 90/100)/ (100 * 900/1000) = 5/4</p><p>Profit % = (S.P  -  C.P) * 100/C.P</p><p>= (5  -  4) * 100/4</p><p>= 25%</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let the C.P be Rs. '100'</p><p>The ratio of S.P to C.P = (100 * 125/100 * 90/100)/ (100 * 900/1000) = 5/4</p><p>Profit % = (S.P  -  C.P) * 100/C.P</p><p>= (5  -  4) * 100/4</p><p>= 25%</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>A sweet shop owner increases the marked price of his products by 35% but offers a 20% discount during a festive sale. However, he also uses a tampered weighing scale that shows 1 kg when he actually gives only 800 grams. What is 20% of the numerical value of his net profit percentage?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2350;&#2367;&#2336;&#2366;&#2312; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2369;&#2325;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2354;&#2367;&#2325; &#2309;&#2346;&#2344;&#2375; &#2313;&#2340;&#2381;&#2346;&#2366;&#2342;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2309;&#2306;&#2325;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; 35% &#2325;&#2368; &#2357;&#2371;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;&#2367; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2354;&#2375;&#2325;&#2367;&#2344; &#2340;&#2381;&#2351;&#2380;&#2361;&#2366;&#2352;&#2368; &#2360;&#2375;&#2354; &#2325;&#2375; &#2342;&#2380;&#2352;&#2366;&#2344; 20% &#2325;&#2368; &#2331;&#2370;&#2335; &#2342;&#2375;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2361;&#2366;&#2354;&#2366;&#2305;&#2325;&#2367;, &#2357;&#2361; &#2319;&#2325; &#2331;&#2375;&#2337;&#2364;&#2331;&#2366;&#2337;&#2364; &#2325;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2340;&#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2370; &#2325;&#2366; &#2349;&#2368; &#2313;&#2346;&#2351;&#2379;&#2327; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2332;&#2379; 1 &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2342;&#2367;&#2326;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2332;&#2348;&#2325;&#2367; &#2357;&#2366;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2357; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2357;&#2361; &#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; 800 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2342;&#2375;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2375; &#2358;&#2369;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2358;&#2340; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2350;&#2325; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; 20% &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["10", "8", "5", "7"], "options_hi": ["10", "8", "5", "7"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>Let the C.P be Rs. '100'</p><p>The ratio of S.P to C.P = (100 * 135/100 * 80/100)/ (100 * 800/1000) = 27/20</p><p>Profit % = (S.P  -  C.P) * 100/C.P</p><p>= (27  -  20) * 100/20</p><p>= 35%</p><p>Now,</p><p>20% of 35 = 7</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let the C.P be Rs. '100'</p><p>The ratio of S.P to C.P = (100 * 135/100 * 80/100)/ (100 * 800/1000) = 27/20</p><p>Profit % = (S.P  -  C.P) * 100/C.P</p><p>= (27  -  20) * 100/20</p><p>= 35%</p><p>Now,</p><p>20% of 35 = 7</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>In a bustling mountain town, a grain merchant sells wheat at no visible profit-the cost and selling prices are both &#8377;X for every 1 kg. However, his old weighing scale secretly gives only 900 grams when it claims to weigh 1 kg, allowing him to earn a 35% profit. After replacing the faulty scale with a correct one that shows 1000 grams accurately, at what price (in &#8377;) should he now sell 1 kg of wheat to maintain the same 35% profit?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340; &#2346;&#2361;&#2366;&#2337;&#2364;&#2368; &#2358;&#2361;&#2352; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;, &#2319;&#2325; &#2309;&#2344;&#2366;&#2332; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2346;&#2366;&#2352;&#2368; &#2348;&#2367;&#2344;&#2366; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2325;&#2375; &#2327;&#2375;&#2361;&#2370;&#2306; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;- &#2354;&#2366;&#2327;&#2340; &#2324;&#2352; &#2348;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2368; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351; &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2361;&#2368; 1 &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#8377;X &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404; &#2361;&#2366;&#2354;&#2366;&#2305;&#2325;&#2367;, &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; &#2346;&#2369;&#2352;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366; &#2340;&#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2370; &#2330;&#2369;&#2346;&#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; 900 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2342;&#2375;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2332;&#2348;&#2325;&#2367; &#2351;&#2361; 1 &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379; &#2357;&#2332;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; &#2342;&#2366;&#2357;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2360;&#2375; &#2313;&#2360;&#2375; 35% &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2325;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2380;&#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2367;&#2354;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2342;&#2379;&#2359;&#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339; &#2340;&#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2370; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2340;&#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2370; &#2360;&#2375; &#2348;&#2342;&#2354;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342; &#2332;&#2379; 1000 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2360;&#2335;&#2368;&#2325; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2342;&#2367;&#2326;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2309;&#2348; &#2313;&#2360;&#2375; 35% &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2348;&#2344;&#2366;&#2319; &#2352;&#2326;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; 1 &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379; &#2327;&#2375;&#2361;&#2370;&#2306; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2325;&#2368;&#2350;&#2340; (&#8377; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;) &#2346;&#2352; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2367;&#2319;?</p>", "options_en": ["1.215X", "1.295X", "1.125X", "1.275X"], "options_hi": ["1.215X", "1.295X", "1.125X", "1.275X"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>Actual C.P = X * 900/1000 = 0.9X</p><p>Profit % = (S.P  -  C.P) * 100/C.P</p><p>35 = (S.P  -  0.9X) * 100/0.9X</p><p>24.3X = 20S.P</p><p>S.P = 1.215X</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Actual C.P = X * 900/1000 = 0.9X</p><p>Profit % = (S.P  -  C.P) * 100/C.P</p><p>35 = (S.P  -  0.9X) * 100/0.9X</p><p>24.3X = 20S.P</p><p>S.P = 1.215X</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>A rice seller makes a 24% profit without changing the cost or selling price, simply because his faulty weighing machine gives only 850 grams instead of 1 kg. If the cost of 1 kg of rice is &#8377;Y, and he switches to a proper machine that correctly weighs 1000 grams, what should be the new selling price (in &#8377;) to maintain the same 24% profit?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2330;&#2366;&#2357;&#2354; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2340;&#2366; &#2354;&#2366;&#2327;&#2340; &#2351;&#2366; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2351; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2348;&#2342;&#2354;&#2366;&#2357; &#2325;&#2367;&#2319; &#2348;&#2367;&#2344;&#2366; 24% &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2325;&#2350;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; &#2311;&#2360;&#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2379;&#2306;&#2325;&#2367; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2368; &#2326;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348; &#2340;&#2380;&#2354; &#2350;&#2358;&#2368;&#2344; 1 &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2332;&#2366;&#2351; &#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; 850 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2342;&#2375;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 1 &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2330;&#2366;&#2357;&#2354; &#2325;&#2368; &#2354;&#2366;&#2327;&#2340; &#8377;Y &#2361;&#2376;, &#2324;&#2352; &#2357;&#2361; &#2319;&#2325; &#2313;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2358;&#2368;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2360;&#2381;&#2357;&#2367;&#2330; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2332;&#2379; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2338;&#2306;&#2327; &#2360;&#2375; 1000 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2340;&#2380;&#2354;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; 24% &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2325;&#2379; &#2348;&#2344;&#2366;&#2319; &#2352;&#2326;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2344;&#2351;&#2366; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2351; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351; (&#8377; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;) &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2367;&#2319;?</p>", "options_en": ["1.025Y", "1.054Y", "1.086Y", "1.075Y"], "options_hi": ["1.025Y", "1.054Y", "1.086Y", "1.075Y"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Actual C.P = Y * 850/1000 = 0.85Y</p><p>Profit % = (S.P  -  C.P) * 100/C.P</p><p>24 = (S.P  -  0.85Y) * 100/0.85Y</p><p>26.35Y = 25S.P</p><p>S.P = 1.054Y</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Actual C.P = Y * 850/1000 = 0.85Y</p><p>Profit % = (S.P  -  C.P) * 100/C.P</p><p>24 = (S.P  -  0.85Y) * 100/0.85Y</p><p>26.35Y = 25S.P</p><p>S.P = 1.054Y</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>A dishonest dealer professes to sell his goods at a cost price but uses a false weight and thus gains 24%. For a kilogram, he uses a weight of - </p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2348;&#2375;&#2312;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2346;&#2366;&#2352;&#2368; &#2309;&#2346;&#2344;&#2375; &#2350;&#2366;&#2354; &#2325;&#2379; &#2354;&#2366;&#2327;&#2340; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351; &#2346;&#2352; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366; &#2342;&#2366;&#2357;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2354;&#2375;&#2325;&#2367;&#2344; &#2327;&#2354;&#2340; &#2357;&#2332;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; &#2313;&#2346;&#2351;&#2379;&#2327; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; &#2311;&#2360; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; 24% &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2325;&#2350;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2319;&#2325; &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319;, &#2357;&#2361; &#2357;&#2332;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; &#2313;&#2346;&#2351;&#2379;&#2327; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; - </p>", "options_en": ["836.45 gm", "860.45 gm", "806.45 gm", "824.45 gm"], "options_hi": ["836.45 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350;", "860.45 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350;", "806.45 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350;", "824.45 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350;"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>Let the actual weight be 'X' gm.</p><p>Gain = (Faulty weight  -  actual weight) * 100/actual weight</p><p>24 = (1000  -  X) * 100/X</p><p>6X = 25000  -  25X</p><p>31X = 25000</p><p>X = 806.45 gm</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let the actual weight be 'X' gm.</p><p>Gain = (Faulty weight  -  actual weight) * 100/actual weight</p><p>24 = (1000  -  X) * 100/X</p><p>6X = 25000  -  25X</p><p>31X = 25000</p><p>X = 806.45 gm</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>A fruit vendor claims to sell his produce at cost price, but he secretly uses a tampered scale and ends up making an 8% profit. To achieve this, how many grams does he actually give when a customer pays for 1 kilogram?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2347;&#2354; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2340;&#2366; &#2309;&#2346;&#2344;&#2375; &#2313;&#2340;&#2381;&#2346;&#2366;&#2342; &#2325;&#2379; &#2354;&#2366;&#2327;&#2340; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351; &#2346;&#2352; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366; &#2342;&#2366;&#2357;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2354;&#2375;&#2325;&#2367;&#2344; &#2357;&#2361; &#2330;&#2369;&#2346;&#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2375; &#2319;&#2325; &#2331;&#2375;&#2337;&#2364;&#2331;&#2366;&#2337;&#2364; &#2325;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2346;&#2376;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366; &#2313;&#2346;&#2351;&#2379;&#2327; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; 8% &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2325;&#2350;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2320;&#2360;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319;, &#2332;&#2348; &#2325;&#2379;&#2312; &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2361;&#2325; 1 &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2349;&#2369;&#2327;&#2340;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2340;&#2379; &#2357;&#2361; &#2357;&#2366;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2357; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2375; &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2342;&#2375;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["850.85 gm", "720.72 gm", "880.08 gm", "925.92 gm"], "options_hi": ["850.85 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350;", "720.72 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350;", "880.08 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350;", "925.92 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350;"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>Let the actual weight be 'X' gm.</p><p>Gain = (Faulty weight  -  actual weight) * 100/actual weight</p><p>8 = (1000  -  X) * 100/X</p><p>2X = 25000  -  25X</p><p>27X = 25000</p><p>X = 925.92 gm</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let the actual weight be 'X' gm.</p><p>Gain = (Faulty weight  -  actual weight) * 100/actual weight</p><p>8 = (1000  -  X) * 100/X</p><p>2X = 25000  -  25X</p><p>27X = 25000</p><p>X = 925.92 gm</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>Pooja sells toffees at Rs. 5X per pack, which she purchased for Rs. 50 per pack. However, instead of giving a full 1000 gm pack, she gives only 800 gm while selling. If Pooja's actual profit percentage is 87.5 then find the value of (X + 4)?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2346;&#2370;&#2332;&#2366; 5X &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2346;&#2376;&#2325;&#2375;&#2335; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2360;&#2375; &#2335;&#2377;&#2347;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;&#2305; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2375; &#2313;&#2360;&#2344;&#2375; 50 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2346;&#2376;&#2325;&#2375;&#2335; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2326;&#2352;&#2368;&#2342;&#2366; &#2341;&#2366;&#2404; &#2361;&#2366;&#2354;&#2366;&#2305;&#2325;&#2367;, &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2375; 1000 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2325;&#2366; &#2346;&#2376;&#2325;&#2375;&#2335; &#2342;&#2375;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2332;&#2366;&#2351;, &#2357;&#2361; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2340;&#2375; &#2360;&#2350;&#2351; &#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; 800 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2342;&#2375;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2346;&#2370;&#2332;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2357;&#2366;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2357;&#2367;&#2325; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2358;&#2340; 87.5 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; (X + 4) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;?</p>", "options_en": ["19", "15", "21", "27"], "options_hi": ["19", "15", "21", "27"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>The ratio of S.P to C.P = (5X/50) * (1000/800) = X/8</p><p>Profit% = (S.P  -  C.P) * 100/C.P</p><p>87.5% = (X  -  8) * 100/8</p><p>700 = (X - 8) * 100</p><p>X = 15</p><p>Now,</p><p>X + 4 = 15 + 4 = 19</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>The ratio of S.P to C.P = (5X/50) * (1000/800) = X/8</p><p>Profit% = (S.P  -  C.P) * 100/C.P</p><p>87.5% = (X  -  8) * 100/8</p><p>700 = (X - 8) * 100</p><p>X = 15</p><p>Now,</p><p>X + 4 = 15 + 4 = 19</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>Lena runs a homemade candle business and sells each candle for &#8377;60, even though she purchases the raw materials for &#8377;50. However, instead of filling the full 100 ml of wax in each candle jar, she only fills it with 85 ml. What is Lena's actual profit percentage?</p><p></p><p></p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2354;&#2368;&#2344;&#2366; &#2328;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352; &#2348;&#2344;&#2368; &#2350;&#2379;&#2350;&#2348;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340;&#2368; &#2325;&#2366; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2357;&#2360;&#2366;&#2351; &#2330;&#2354;&#2366;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351;&#2375;&#2325; &#2350;&#2379;&#2350;&#2348;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340;&#2368; &#2325;&#2379; 60 &#2337;&#2377;&#2354;&#2352; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2332;&#2348;&#2325;&#2367; &#2357;&#2361; &#2325;&#2330;&#2381;&#2330;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2354; 50 &#2337;&#2377;&#2354;&#2352; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2326;&#2352;&#2368;&#2342;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2361;&#2366;&#2354;&#2366;&#2306;&#2325;&#2367;, &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351;&#2375;&#2325; &#2350;&#2379;&#2350;&#2348;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340;&#2368; &#2332;&#2366;&#2352; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; 100 &#2350;&#2367;&#2354;&#2368;&#2354;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352; &#2350;&#2379;&#2350; &#2349;&#2352;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2332;&#2366;&#2351;, &#2357;&#2361; &#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; 85 &#2350;&#2367;&#2354;&#2368;&#2354;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352; &#2361;&#2368; &#2349;&#2352;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2354;&#2368;&#2344;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2357;&#2366;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2357;&#2367;&#2325; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2358;&#2340; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["47.176%", "41.176%", "43.176%", "45.176%"], "options_hi": ["47.176%", "41.176%", "43.176%", "45.176%"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>The ratio of S.P. to C.P = (60/50) * 100/85 = 24/17</p><p>Profit % = (S.P  -  C.P) * 100/C.P</p><p>= (24  -  17) * 100/17</p><p>= 41.176%</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>The ratio of S.P. to C.P = (60/50) * 100/85 = 24/17</p><p>Profit % = (S.P  -  C.P) * 100/C.P</p><p>= (24  -  17) * 100/17</p><p>= 41.176%</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>A dishonest shopkeeper claims to sell at a rate of Rs. 86 per kg. The cost price of the rice is Rs. 86 per kg. Not satisfied with this, he tries to make a profit by removing X gm for each kg. What is the value of X if the shopkeeper's gain percentage (600/19)%?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2348;&#2375;&#2312;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2342;&#2369;&#2325;&#2366;&#2344;&#2342;&#2366;&#2352; 86 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2360;&#2375; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366; &#2342;&#2366;&#2357;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2330;&#2366;&#2357;&#2354; &#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2351; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351; 86 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2311;&#2360;&#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2340;&#2369;&#2359;&#2381;&#2335; &#2344; &#2361;&#2379;&#2344;&#2375; &#2346;&#2352;, &#2357;&#2361; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351;&#2375;&#2325; &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379; &#2360;&#2375; X &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2344;&#2367;&#2325;&#2366;&#2354;&#2325;&#2352; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2325;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2325;&#2379;&#2358;&#2367;&#2358; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2342;&#2369;&#2325;&#2366;&#2344;&#2342;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2366; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2358;&#2340; (600/19)% &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; X &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["210", "220", "240", "250"], "options_hi": ["210", "220", "240", "250"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>Gain = (Faulty weight  -  actual weight) * 100/actual weight</p><p>(600/19) = X * 100/(1000 - X)</p><p>19X = 6000 - 6X</p><p>25X = 6000</p><p>X = 240 gm</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Gain = (Faulty weight  -  actual weight) * 100/actual weight</p><p>(600/19) = X * 100/(1000 - X)</p><p>19X = 6000 - 6X</p><p>25X = 6000</p><p>X = 240 gm</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>A vendor at a local fair claims to sell sugar at &#8377;72 per kg, which is also his actual cost price. However, to earn a hidden profit, he gives only 700 grams instead of 1 full kilogram. What is the vendor's actual profit percentage?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344;&#2368;&#2351; &#2350;&#2375;&#2354;&#2375; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2340;&#2366; 72 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2360;&#2375; &#2330;&#2368;&#2344;&#2368; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366; &#2342;&#2366;&#2357;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2332;&#2379; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; &#2357;&#2366;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2357;&#2367;&#2325; &#2354;&#2366;&#2327;&#2340; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351; &#2349;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2361;&#2366;&#2354;&#2366;&#2306;&#2325;&#2367;, &#2331;&#2369;&#2346;&#2375; &#2361;&#2369;&#2319; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2325;&#2379; &#2325;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319;, &#2357;&#2361; 1 &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2332;&#2366;&#2351; &#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; 700 &#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2350; &#2330;&#2368;&#2344;&#2368; &#2342;&#2375;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2340;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2357;&#2366;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2357;&#2367;&#2325; &#2354;&#2366;&#2349; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2358;&#2340; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["37.85%", "40.85%", "39.85%", "42.85%"], "options_hi": ["37.85%", "40.85%", "39.85%", "42.85%"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>Gain = (Faulty weight  -  actual weight) * 100/actual weight</p><p>= (1000  -  700) * 100/700</p><p>= 42.85%</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Gain = (Faulty weight  -  actual weight) * 100/actual weight</p><p>= (1000  -  700) * 100/700</p><p>= 42.85%</p>"}]}